Patch inventory (all under /private/tmp/aq0-mutants-1c763a10):
1. 01-predecode-count.patch
   SHA-256 77d7f4a90f8583729e7fd529de9cc2f2b8edddc179ccecef2ae56a27f59196a9
   Predicate: evidence_bytes.len() > 7 early bound, before decode/insert.
